    {
      "name": "Awaken Tree",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The arboreal regent causes a tree within 180 feet to uproot itself and fight as a minion using the statistics for an Awakened Tree. The arboreal regent can control up to two awakened trees at a time, and it can issue commands to both trees as a single action, which has the concentrate and auditory traits.</p>",
